title: $:/plugins/rimir/outline/key-groups/change
caption: Change
hint: In selection mode, on the selected block (double-click edits too). Moves, indents and deletes carry the children. Copy, cut and paste use the system clipboard (Cmd on Mac, also the browser's Edit menu): a copy pastes formatted into e-mail and the like; a paste goes after the selected block, its levels adapted. Undo and redo cover the outline's own changes in this session.
list: outline-edit outline-add outline-menu outline-delete outline-open outline-move-up outline-move-down outline-indent outline-promote outline-undo outline-redo

<table class="rr-ol-keys-table"><tbody>
<tr><td class="rr-ol-keys-key"><kbd>Ctrl-C</kbd></td><td>copy the selected block with its children</td></tr>
<tr><td class="rr-ol-keys-key"><kbd>Ctrl-X</kbd></td><td>cut it (no question; undo brings it back)</td></tr>
<tr><td class="rr-ol-keys-key"><kbd>Ctrl-V</kbd></td><td>paste after the selected block, levels adapted</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
